Package: raye-wine-compat
Architecture: all
# winetricks depends on "wine". WineHQ's package conflicts with anything
# else that provides it, so this lives apart: raye-windows-apps takes it
# only where no other Wine is installed, and an update never has to
# remove one.
Depends: raye-wine, ${misc:Depends}
Provides: wine
Description: Raye's layer for Windows programs: the name other packages ask for
 Lets packages that need "wine", such as winetricks, install on top of
 raye-wine. It holds no files.
